WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.680
You thought you could kill Charlie Kirk?

00:00:03.680 --> 00:00:06.220
You have made him a mortal.

00:00:06.220 --> 00:00:08.700
You have immortalized Charlie Kirk.

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:18.219
And now millions will carry on his legacy, and we will devote the rest of our lives to

00:00:18.219 --> 00:00:23.520
finishing the causes for which Charlie gave his last measure of devotion.

